  {
    "name": "Video Library",
    "description": "One card: the Video Library, a YouTube widget served by openbb-api itself, which openbq-docker serves from v3 on (the openbb-videos extension, first written in openbb-docker and adapted from OpenBB's reference backend; MIT, see openbb-docker's THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md). Pick one of two sample videos; the endpoint answers the bare watch URL as text/plain and the YouTube card frames it. Widget id confirmed against the extension's own widgets.json build on OpenBB 5.0.0.",
    "img": "/openbq/bdobb-logo.svg",
    "img_dark": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
    "img_light": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
